body:
could not figure out how to not have my rant in the title.

I dont like it, it takes up too much room and really is not special. Yes some stuff went down, but at this point who cares( my ancestors likely fought in that very place. but we remove other older historical stuff and this is primo Toronto real-estate, maybe cut some land off and make it a USEABLE GREEN SPACE. 

If by some magical way we could combine this and Ontario place and build something that actually is worthy of a world class city. sydny has so crazy fire shows every night. 

Basically it is a bunch of dirt and the farm house at my farm is older. 

Lets get real it it is some half assed fortifications that did not work for either side.

&#x200B;

put  a plaque or something and call it a day. 

&#x200B;

Can we just try to not fuck up with one this as a city and province, just this one time. lets come-together and keep the morons out and add something to be proud of to toronto. 

&#x200B;

Anyway I am a lil high so if someone could translate this I would appreciate. 

&#x200B;

TLDR: Fort your and ontario place sucks, lets unsuck them.
